     8737           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     8738       End.
     8739     End.
     8740     if c-f-crsa-sum-o <>  ?  then do :
     8741       c-f-crsa-sum-o:screen-value = string(p-crsa-sum-o) .
     8742       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
