     9514       End.
     9515     End.
     9516     if c-f-crsa-sum-o <>  ?  then do :
     9517       c-f-crsa-sum-o:screen-value = string(f-crsa-sum-o) .
     9518       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
     9519           ( line-counter( OutStream ) >= page-size( OutStream ) )          then DO:
     9520           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     9521       End.
     9522     End.
     9523                 display stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas  no-error .
     9524                 DOWN stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas.
     9525                 if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     9526                   string(n-nn)                      CHR(9)
     9527                   v-bar-code                        CHR(9)
     9528                   (gds-obj.artic)                   CHR(9)
     9529                   goods.gds-name                    CHR(9)
     9530                   excel-qnty(f-qnty        )        CHR(9)
     9531                   excel-sum (f-cost-sum    )        CHR(9)
     9532                   excel-sum (f-sale-sum    )        CHR(9)
     9533                   excel-sum (f-sale-other  )        CHR(9)
     9534                   excel-sum (f-crsa-sum    )        CHR(9)
     9535                   excel-sum (f-qnty-all    )        CHR(9)
     9536                   excel-sum (f-cost-sum-all)        CHR(9)
     9537                   excel-sum (f-crsa-sum-all)        CHR(9)
     9538                   excel-sum (f-qnty-o      )        CHR(9)
     9539                   excel-qnty(f-cost-sum-o  )        CHR(9)
     9540                   excel-qnty(f-crsa-sum-o  )        chr(10) .
     9541                   run display-prt in this-procedure .
     9542            End.
     9543   end procedure.
